  "description": "Official .NET SDK for Guardhouse Cloud. Provides client credentials flow, JWT signature validation (RFC 7515), and token introspection (RFC 7662). Includes JWKS caching with lazy refresh, configurable validation rules, and HTTP resilience with Polly. Supports .NET 6.0 through .NET 10.0.",
